      "content": "i know i should probably call them but it's like 2am and i don't want to deal with the ER if it's just inflammation. it's mostly just a dull ache and it doesn't look super red or anything. do u think i can just take some extra ibuprofen or maybe some of that herbal anti-inflammatory stuff i have in the cabinet to help it go down? i just want to sleep it off.",
